---

Note on bundled third-party binaries: Carbon ships alongside the Tesseract OCR engine
(https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract, Apache-2.0) and its tessdata
(https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata). These executables and data files are
not part of this repository (they are fetched per-machine into src-tauri/binaries/tesseract)
and remain under their own respective licenses. They are bundled into the NSIS
installer via Tauri's bundle.resources.
